  id: memory_4
  titleEN: "Memory IV \u2014 The Lighthouse"
  titleID: "Kenangan IV \u2014 Mercusuar"
  memory: 1
  music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3da5ac83c4bd77f4e80e1484990b8e80, type: 3}
  slides:
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 75b1f869ae9e15242a908cc0a5b69c54, type: 3}
    textEN: One night at Saltreed, a storm caught me far from shore. I could not
      see my own hands.
    textID: Suatu malam di Saltreed, badai menangkapku jauh dari pantai. Aku bahkan
      tak bisa melihat tanganku sendiri.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7b8905382e9d41f42917098673944633, type: 3}
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cd667718b3691754e997ca2a7bf1d389, type: 3}
    voiceM: {fileID: 0}
    voiceMID: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 5.5
    zoomFrom: 1.04
    zoomTo: 1.14
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0}
    panTo: {x: 0.02, y: -0.02}
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f963e590d62240e4395e8b6a178d026f, type: 3}
    textEN: Then the lighthouse turned toward me. My old friend Ben kept it burning
      all night, just for me.
    textID: Lalu cahaya mercusuar berputar ke arahku. Sahabatku Ben menjaganya tetap
      menyala sepanjang malam, hanya untukku.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bcba153b5d9e4bd4ba7522ba473c1252, type: 3}
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9cfd92c3d353d2446915b7ea4fdeeb7d, type: 3}
    voiceM: {fileID: 0}
    voiceMID: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 5.5
    zoomFrom: 1.04
    zoomTo: 1.14
    panFrom: {x: -0.02, y: 0.01}
    panTo: {x: 0.02, y: 0}
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2f6c1b00f8f41cc419fa0433a61f978d, type: 3}
    textEN: 'At dawn, the old king grouper surfaced beside my boat, as if to say:
      go home. Always find your way home.'
    textID: 'Saat fajar, raja kerapu tua muncul di samping perahuku, seolah berkata:
      pulanglah. Selalu temukan jalan pulang.'
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 79114fc058758224a8fe863819da2aab, type: 3}
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 814af59485a91fa428617d21b8f01b4c, type: 3}
    voiceM: {fileID: 0}
    voiceMID: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 5.5
    zoomFrom: 1.04
    zoomTo: 1.14
    panFrom: {x: 0.02, y: -0.01}
    panTo: {x: -0.01, y: 0.02}
